  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society in Action (CSA) Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">csa activities are expected to enhance the organizational resiliency of civil society organizations, making them less vulnerable to a restrictive operating environment by helping csos to identify new and sustainable revenue streams such as domestic funding sources; to recognize and address their own internal vulnerabilities; and to communicate and engage more effectively with government and citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
